hadiths[400]{hadithnumber,text}:
"609","[AI-translation] Kya tum jante ho Ramazan ka naam kyun hai? Kyunke woh gunahon ko jala deta hai."
"610","[AI-translation] Ramazan na kaho, kyunke woh Allah ke naamon mein se ek naam hai; balke mah-e-Ramazan kaho."
"611","[AI-translation] Roza rakho sehatmand ho jaoge."
"612","[AI-translation] Har cheez ki zakat hai, aur jism ki zakat roza hai."
"613","[AI-translation] Rozedar ka har baal us ke liye tasbeeh karta hai; qayamat ke din rozedar mardon aur aurton ke liye Arsh ke neeche sone ka dastarkhwan bichhaya jaega."
"614","[AI-translation] Agar Allah aasman aur zameen walon ko bolne ki ijazat de to woh mah-e-Ramazan ke rozedaron ko jannat ki basharat denge."
"615","[AI-translation] Jo baghair uzr Ramazan ka ek roza chhore to us par ek mahine ke roze hain."
"616","[AI-translation] Jo Ramazan ka ek roza chhore to use oont ki qurbani deni chahie."
"617","[AI-translation] Jo Ramazan ka ek roza chhore phir qaza se pehle mar jae, to har din ke badle ek miskeen ko ek mudd khana khilana hoga."
"618","[AI-translation] Jo halal khajoor se iftar kare to us ki namaz mein chaar sau namazen barha di jati hain."
"619","[AI-translation] Jab Ramazan durust ho jae to saara saal durust ho jata hai."
"620","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah Ramazan ke har din chhe lakh logon ko jahannam se azad farmata hai."
"621","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah Ramazan ki har raat iftar ke waqt das lakh logon ko jahannam se azad farmata hai."
"622","[AI-translation] Beshak rozedar ki iftar ke waqt dua radd nahin hoti."
"623","[AI-translation] Teen afraad se khane peene ki nemat ke bare mein nahin poocha jaega: iftar karne wala, sehri karne wala, aur mehman ki mezbaani karne wala."
"624","[AI-translation] Teen cheezen roza nahin tortin: qai, pichhne lagwana, aur ehtelam."
"625","[AI-translation] Jo aurat ko is tarah dekhe ke kapdon ke peeche se us ki haddion ka hajm us par zahir ho jae jabke woh rozedar ho, to Beshak us ka roza toot gaya."
"626","[AI-translation] Safar mein Ramazan ka roza rakhne wala hazar mein roza na rakhne wale ki tarah hai."
"627","[AI-translation] Jo mar jae jabke us par roze hon, to har din ke badle us ki taraf se ek miskeen ko khana khilaya jae."
"628","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Arafaat mein Arafa ke din roza rakhne se mana farmaya."
"629","[AI-translation] Ashura ke din roza rakho aur us mein Yahud ki mukhalifat karo: us se pehle ek din ya us ke baad ek din roza rakho."
"630","[AI-translation] Shurad pehla parinda hai jis ne Ashura ka roza rakha."
"631","[AI-translation] Jo Ashura ke din apne ghar walon par wus'at kare to Allah us par saara saal wus'at farmayega."
"632","[AI-translation] Jo Rajab ki ek raat [ibadat mein] zinda rakhe aur ek din roza rakhe, to Allah use jannat ke phal khilaega ..."
"633","[AI-translation] Jo Rajab mein teen din roza rakhe, to Allah us ke liye mahine bhar ke rozon ka sawab likh dega ..."
"634","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha gaya: Ramazan ke baad kaunse roze afzal hain? Aap ne farmaya: Shaban ke."
"635","[AI-translation] Ayyam-e-beez ka pehla din teen hazar saal ke barabar, doosra din das hazar saal ke barabar, aur teesra din terah hazar saal ke barabar hai."
"636","[AI-translation] Jo nafl roza rakhe, agar use zameen bhar sona diya jae tab bhi us ka ajr poora na hoga."
"637","[AI-translation] Jo nafl roza rakhe aur koi us par muttala na ho, to Allah us ke badle use jannat se kam par razi na karega."
"638","[AI-translation] Rozedar ibadat mein hai agarche woh apne bistar par soya ho."
"639","[AI-translation] Hajj aur umra donon farz hain."
"640","[AI-translation] Tum umra karo yeh tumhare liye behtar hai."
"641","[AI-translation] Hajj jihad hai, jabke umra nafl hai."
"642","[AI-translation] Jo Baitullah ke safar ka saman aur sawari rakhte hue hajj na kare, to parwah nahin woh Yahudi ho kar mare ya Isai ho kar."
"643","[AI-translation] Jo hajj se pehle nikah kare us ne gunah se aaghaz kiya."
"644","[AI-translation] Jab haji apne ghar se nikle woh Allah ki hifazat mein hai; agar hajj ke arkaan poore karne se pehle mar jae to Allah us ke pichhle gunah bakhsh dega ..."
"645","[AI-translation] Agar log jante hajiyon ko un par kya fazeelat hai to woh un ke paas aate yahan tak ke un ke paon dho dete."
"646","[AI-translation] Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mashriq walon ke liye Aqeeq ko meeqat muqarrar farmaya."
"647","[AI-translation] Jo Masjid Aqsa se hajj ya umre ka ehram bandhe Masjid Haram ki taraf, to us ke agle pichhle gunah bakhsh diye jaenge, ya us ke liye jannat wajib hogi."
"648","[AI-translation] Use sar mein takleef hui to us ne sar mundwaya, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use hukm diya ke ek gae ki qurbani de."
"649","[AI-translation] Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath hajj kiya, hamare sath aurten aur bachche the; to ham ne bachchon ki taraf se talbiya kaha aur un ki taraf se rami ki."
"650","[AI-translation] Jab woh apne talbiye se farigh hote to Allah se Us ki raza aur jannat mangte, aur Us ki rehmat se jahannam ki aag se panah mangte."
"651","[AI-translation] Jab woh Baitullah dekhte to donon hath uthate phir farmate: Aey Allah is ghar ki sharafat, azmat, izzat aur haibat badha; aur jo us ka hajj ya umra kare us ki sharafat aur izzat badha, sharafat, azmat, izzat aur neki ke sath."
"652","[AI-translation] Baitullah ka ek Rabb hai jo us ki hifazat farmata hai."
"653","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah ne is ghar ke bare mein wada farmaya hai ke har saal chhe lakh ... [us ka hajj karenge]."
"654","[AI-translation] Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: Jab Main duniya ko tabah karne ka irada karun to apne ghar se shuru karunga phir use tabah karunga, phir us ke baad duniya ko tabah karunga."
"655","[AI-translation] Rukn-e-Yamani ke paas sattar hazar farishte muqarrar hain; to jo kahe: Aey Allah Beshak main Tujh se duniya aur aakhirat mein muafi aur aafiyat mangta hun, Aey hamare Rabb hamen ... de, to tamam farishte aameen kahenge. Aur jo Baitullah ka tawaf kare aur sirf yeh kalimaat kahe Subhanallah wal-hamdulillah wa la ilaha illallah wallahu akbar wa la haula wa la quwwata illa billah, to us ki das buraiyan mita di jaengi, das nekiyan likh di jaengi, aur das darje buland kar diye jaenge."
"656","[AI-translation] Jo barish mein ek hafte tawaf kare to us ke pichhle gunah bakhsh diye jaenge."
"657","[AI-translation] Jo achchi tarah wuzu kare phir Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan chale, to Allah us ke har qadam par sattar hazar darje likh dega."
"658","[AI-translation] Zamzam ka pani aur jahannam ki aag kisi bande ke pet mein kabhi jama nahin ho sakte ..."
"659","[AI-translation] Beshak sawar haji ke liye us ki sawari ke har qadam par sattar nekiyan hain, jabke paidal chalne wale ke har qadam par saat sau nekiyan hain."
"660","[AI-translation] Hajj ke kamal mein oonton ki qurbani bhi shamil hai."
"661","[AI-translation] Hajj ke kamal mein yeh bhi shamil hai ke tum apne ghar walon ke ilaqe se ehram bandho."
"662","[AI-translation] Jo meri ummat ki taraf se hajj kare us ki misaal Musa ki maan ki tarah hai: woh use doodh pilati thin aur Firaun se ujrat bhi leti thin."
"663","[AI-translation] Jo Makkah ke raste mein haji hote hue mar jae to Allah na use pesh karega na us ka hisab lega."
"664","[AI-translation] Jo donon Haramon mein se kisi mein mare us ke liye meri shafa'at wajib hogi ..."
"665","[AI-translation] Jo Madinah ko Yasrab kahe use teen martaba Allah se maghfirat mangni chahie."
"666","[AI-translation] Jo meri masjid mein chalis namazen is tarah padhe ke ek namaz bhi na chhoote, to us ke liye jahannam se azadi, azab se nijat, aur nifaq se bari likh di jaegi."
"667","[AI-translation] Jo Madinah mein sawab ki niyyat se meri ziyarat kare, main qayamat ke din us ka gawah aur shafi hunga."
"668","[AI-translation] Jo qasdan meri ziyarat kare woh qayamat ke din meri panah mein hoga."
"669","[AI-translation] Jo ek hi saal mein meri aur mere walid Ibrahim ki ziyarat kare woh jannat mein dakhil hoga."
"670","[AI-translation] Jo hajj-e-Islam kare, meri qabr ki ziyarat kare, jihad kare, aur Bait-ul-Maqdis mein mujh par durood bheje, to Allah us se faraiz ke bare mein nahin poochega."
"671","[AI-translation] Jo wus'at rakhte hue mere paas na aae [meri qabr ki ziyarat na kare], to Beshak us ne mujh se jafa ki."
"672","[AI-translation] Jo apne walidain ki taraf se hajj kare ya un ka qarz ada kare, to Allah use qayamat ke din nek logon ke sath uthaega."
"673","[AI-translation] Beemariyan Allah ki taraf se bande ke liye tohfe hain; bandon mein Allah ko sab se mahboob woh hai jis ke tohfe sab se ziyada hon."
"674","[AI-translation] Beemari ek sath utarti hai jabke sehat thodi thodi utarti hai."
"675","[AI-translation] Museebat us din us wale ka chehra safed karegi jis din chehre kaale honge."
"676","[AI-translation] Allah jis ki duniya mein beenai le le, to Allah par wajib hai ke us ki aankhen jahannam ki aag na dekhen."
"677","[AI-translation] Jab banda teen din beemar rahe to woh gunahon se is tarah nikal jata hai jaise us din us ki maan ne use jana tha."
"678","[AI-translation] Beemar hone ka bahana na karo warna beemar ho jaoge; apni qabren na khodo warna mar jaoge."
"679","[AI-translation] Paanch duaen qubool hoti hain: mazloom ki dua yahan tak ke badla le, haji ki dua yahan tak ke wapas aae, mujahid ki dua yahan tak ke [ghar walon mein] baithe, beemar ki dua yahan tak ke sehat ho, aur bhai ki bhai ke liye peeth peeche dua; phir Aap ne farmaya: in duaon mein sab se jaldi qubool hone wali bhai ki bhai ke liye peeth peeche dua hai."
"680","[AI-translation] Beemaron ki iyadat karo aur un se kaho ke tumhare liye dua karen, kyunke beemar ki dua qubool hoti hai aur us ke gunah bakhsh diye jate hain."
"681","[AI-translation] Jab tum mein se kisi ka beemar kisi cheez ki khwahish kare to use khilao."
"682","[AI-translation] Jo achchi tarah wuzu kare phir sawab ki niyyat se apne Musalman bhai ki iyadat kare, to use jahannam se sattar saal ki doori par kar diya jaega."
"683","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) teen [din] ke baad hi beemar ki iyadat farmate the."
"684","[AI-translation] Jo beemar ki iyadat kare aur us ke paas ghadi bhar baithe, to Allah use hazar saal ke amal ka sawab dega ..."
"685","[AI-translation] Mere nazdeek beemar ki iyadat chalis ya pachaas saal ki ibadat se ziyada mahboob hai."
"686","[AI-translation] Iyadat mein waqfa karo [roz na jao]."
"687","[AI-translation] Teen afraad ke mareez ki iyadat na karo: aankh ke dard wale, daant ke dard wale, aur phode wale."
"688","[AI-translation] Us ki iyadat na karo jo tumhari iyadat na kare."
"689","[AI-translation] Jab tum beemar ke paas jao to use us ki maut ke bare mein tasalli do; yeh kuch nahin rokta lekin mareez ke dil ko khush karta hai."
"690","[AI-translation] Jo beemari mein mare woh shaheed ki maut mara."
"691","[AI-translation] Musafir ki maut shahadat hai."
"692","[AI-translation] Beshak woh saat mauton se panah mangte the: achanak maut, saanp ke kaatne, [darinde ke] hamle, doobne, jalne, kisi cheez par girne ya kisi cheez ke [upar] girne, aur maidan-e-jang se bhagte hue qatl hone se."
"693","[AI-translation] Woh achanak maut se panah mangte the aur marne se pehle beemar hona pasand farmate the."
"694","[AI-translation] Maut wa'iz ke liye kafi hai."
"695","[AI-translation] Mehroom woh hai jo [waseeyat likhne] se mehroom raha."
"696","[AI-translation] Apne marne walon ko yeh kalimaat kehne ki talqeen karo: La ilaha illallah-ul-Haleem-ul-Kareem Subhanallah-e-Rabb-il-Arsh-il-Azeem Alhamdulillah-e-Rabb-il-Aalameen."
"697","[AI-translation] Jo Bait-ul-Maqdis mein mare goya woh aasman mein mara."
"698","[AI-translation] Agar maut ki takleef ka ek qatra zameen ke tamam pahadon par rakh diya jae to woh pighal jaen."
"699","[AI-translation] Beshak momin ki rooh jab qabz ki jati hai to use rehmat wale lete hain ..."
"700","[AI-translation] Maut har Musalman ke liye kaffara hai."
"701","[AI-translation] Maut momin ke liye kaffara hai."
"702","[AI-translation] Apne faut-shudgan ke paas Yasin padho."
"703","[AI-translation] Jis maiyyat ke paas Yasin padhi jae Allah us par aasani farmata hai."
"704","[AI-translation] Beshak tumhare a'mal tumhare faut-shuda qareebi rishtedaron ko dikhaye jate hain; agar achche hon to woh khush hote hain; agar is ke siwa hon to [dua karte hain]: Aey Allah unhen maut na de yahan tak ke unhen hidayat de jaise Hamen hidayat di."
"705","[AI-translation] Apne murdon ko apne bure a'mal se ruswa na karo, kyunke woh qabr walon mein se tumhare doston ko dikhaye jate hain."
"706","[AI-translation] Jo museebat par Inna lillahi wa inna ilaihi raji'oon kahe, to Allah us ki museebat ka badla dega, us ka anjaam achcha karega, aur use aisa badal dega jo use pasand ho."
"707","[AI-translation] Meri ummat ko museebat par woh diya gaya jo kisi ummat ko nahin diya gaya: Inna lillahi wa inna ilaihi raji'oon."
"708","[AI-translation] Zinda ke rone ki wajah se maiyyat par garam pani chhidka jata hai."
"709","[AI-translation] Teen cheezen moakhar na karo ... janaza jab hazir ho ..."
"710","[AI-translation] Musalman ki laash ko us ke ghar walon mein rokna jaiz nahin."
"711","[AI-translation] Apne murdon se waisa sulook karo jaisa tum dulhanon se karte ho."
"712","[AI-translation] Jo maiyyat ko ghusl de to woh gunahon se is tarah nikal jata hai jaise us din us ki maan ne use jana tha."
"713","[AI-translation] Agar koi aurat mardon mein mare aur wahan us ke siwa koi aurat na ho, aur koi mard aurton mein mare aur wahan us ke siwa koi mard na ho, to unhen tayammum kara kar dafan kiya jae; donon us ki tarah honge jis ke paas pani na ho."
"714","[AI-translation] Beshak Hazrat Fatimah (Raziyallahu anha) ne apni wafaat se pehle khud ghusl kiya aur kafan pehna; to Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) is par razi ho gae."
"715","[AI-translation] Apne maqtooleen ko ghusl do."
"716","[AI-translation] Apni raan na kholo aur kisi ki raan na dekho, khwah woh zinda ho ya murda."
"717","[AI-translation] Kafan mein ziyadati na karo, kyunke woh jaldi utar liya jata hai."
"718","[AI-translation] Apne murdon ke kafan achche karo, kyunke woh qabron mein ek doosre ki ziyarat karte hain."
"719","[AI-translation] Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko saat kapdon mein kafan diya gaya."
"720","[AI-translation] Beshak Aap ne janaza dekha jise log jaldi le ja rahe the, to farmaya: Tum par sukoon lazim hai."
"721","[AI-translation] Daud se kam [raftar]."
"722","[AI-translation] Jo janaze ke sath jae use charpai ke tamam pehluon se kandha dena chahie."
"723","[AI-translation] Jo charpai ke chaaron pehluon se kandha de, to Allah us ke chalis kabeera gunah bakhsh dega."
"724","[AI-translation] Apne marne walon ko La ilaha illallah ka zade-rah do."
"725","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se janaze ke peeche chalte hue siwae La ilaha illallah ke kuch sunai na deta tha."
"726","[AI-translation] Bande ko us ki maut ke baad sab se pehla badla yeh milta hai ke us ke janaze ke peeche chalne walon ko bakhsh diya jata hai."
"727","[AI-translation] Allah ke han momin ki izzat yeh hai ke Woh us ke janaze ke sath chalne walon ko bakhsh deta hai."
"728","[AI-translation] Kya tum haya nahin karte ke Allah ke farishte apne qadmon par chal rahe hain jabke tum sawar ho?"
"729","[AI-translation] Us [janaze] ke aage na chalo."
"730","[AI-translation] Woh janaze ke peeche chalte the."
"731","[AI-translation] Use chhor do aey Umar!"
"732","[AI-translation] Jab kuch aurten baithi thin, Aap ne farmaya: Tumhen kis ne bithaya? Unhon ne kaha: Ham janaze ka intezar kar rahi hain ..."
"733","[AI-translation] Aurton ke ijtima mein koi khair nahin siwae masjid ya maqtool ke janaze mein."
"734","[AI-translation] Aurton ke liye janaze ke peeche chalne mein ajr nahin."
"735","[AI-translation] Jo janaza dekh kar kahe Allahu Akbar, Allah aur Us ke Rasool ne sach farmaya ..."
"736","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam), Abu Bakr aur Umar ne kisi cheez ki utni ijazat nahin di jitni maiyyat ki namaz ki di, yani waqt muqarrar nahin kiya."
"737","[AI-translation] Apne bachchon ki janaze ki namaz padho."
"738","[AI-translation] Bachche ki janaze ki namaz nahin padhi jaegi."
"739","[AI-translation] Jab na-tamam bachcha cheekh mare to us ki janaze ki namaz padhi jaegi aur woh waris bhi banega."
"740","[AI-translation] Aakhri [janaze ki] takbeerat jo Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kahin chaar thin."
"741","[AI-translation] Farishton ne Hazrat Adam (Alaihissalam) ki janaze ki namaz padhi aur chaar takbeerat kahin."
"742","[AI-translation] Hamen hukm diya gaya ke apne maiyyat par Surah Fatiha padhen."
"743","[AI-translation] Jo masjid mein janaze ki namaz padhe us ke liye kuch [ajr] nahin."
"744","[AI-translation] Doobne wale ko ek din raat chhor kar dafan kiya jae."
"745","[AI-translation] Apne murdon ko nek logon ke darmiyan dafan karo, kyunke maiyyat bure padosi se takleef pata hai jaise zinda bure padosi se takleef pata hai."
"746","[AI-translation] Har ghar ka darwaza hai, aur qabr ka darwaza us ke qadmon ki taraf hai."
"747","[AI-translation] Aurat ke do parde hain: qabr aur shohar."
"748","[AI-translation] Qabr ka azab haq hai; jo us par iman na lae woh us mein azab payega."
"749","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki qabr par pani chhidka gaya; Aap ki qabr par pani chhidakne wale Hazrat Bilal bin Rabah (Raziyallahu anhu) the, sar ki taraf se shuru kiya yahan tak ke qadmon tak pahunche."
"750","[AI-translation] Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne bete Ibrahim ki qabr par pani chhidka aur us par kankariyan rakhin."
"751","[AI-translation] Meri ummat ka apni qabron mein lamba theharna un ke gunahon ki safai hai."
"752","[AI-translation] Jo museebat-zada ko tasalli de us ke liye us jaisa ajr hai."
"753","[AI-translation] Apne bhai ki [museebat par] khushi zahir na karo, warna Allah us par rehem farmayega aur tumhen aazmaish mein dalega."
"754","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qabron ki ziyarat karne wali aurton par la'nat farmai."
"755","[AI-translation] Jo apni maan ki qabr ki ziyarat kare us ke liye umra hai."
"756","[AI-translation] Jo unhen salam kare woh qayamat ke din use jawab denge."
"757","[AI-translation] Murde ki haddi torna gunah mein zinda ki haddi torne ki tarah hai."
"758","[AI-translation] Kya woh sunte hain? Aap ne farmaya: Woh sunte hain lekin jawab dene ki taqat nahin rakhte."
"759","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah zameen walon ki dua se qabr walon par pahadon jaise [rehmaten] nazil farmata hai ..."
"760","[AI-translation] Jo faqr ke khauf se nikah na kare woh ham mein se nahin."
"761","[AI-translation] Jo nikah ki taqat rakhte hue nikah na kare us ka mujh se koi talluq nahin."
"762","[AI-translation] Deen ke mamle mein behtareen madadgar nek biwi hai."
"763","[AI-translation] Allah ke khauf ke baad momin mard ke liye sab se behtar faeda nek biwi hai."
"764","[AI-translation] Kya main tumhen aadmi ke behtareen khazane ke bare mein na bataun? Nek biwi."
"765","[AI-translation] Tumhare kuwaron mein sab se bure hain."
"766","[AI-translation] Agar meri umar mein se sirf ek din baqi rahe to bhi main [biwi se nikah karke] Allah se milunga."
"767","[AI-translation] Shadi-shuda ki do rak'aten kuwaron ki sattar rak'aton se afzal hain."
"768","[AI-translation] Kuwara jahannam ki [aag ka nishana] hai."
"769","[AI-translation] Ek dehati ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se khwahish aur bhook ki shikayat ki, to Aap ne use hukm diya ke pehli aurat se nikah kare jo use mile jis ka shohar na ho ..."
"770","[AI-translation] Jab tum mein se koi aurat se nikah chahe to jaise us ke chehre ke bare mein pooche us ke baalon ke bare mein bhi pooche, kyunke baal bhi khubsurti ki jagah hain."
"771","[AI-translation] Arab ek doosre ke hum-palla hain ..."
"772","[AI-translation] Jo Allah se pakeezgi mein milna chahe woh aazad aurton se nikah kare."
"773","[AI-translation] Aazad aurten ghar ki islah ka zariya hain, jabke laundiyan ghar ki barbadi ka zariya hain."
"774","[AI-translation] Jo apni beti ka nikah fasiq se kare, Beshak us ne us se qata-talluq kiya."
"775","[AI-translation] Aurton se sirf rishtedari ki bunyad par nikah na karo, kyunke yehi cheez [baad mein] qata-talluqi ka sabab banti hai."
"776","[AI-translation] Jo aurat se us ki izzat ke liye nikah kare, Allah use sirf zillat mein badhayega; jo us ke maal ke liye nikah kare, Allah use sirf faqr mein badhayega; jo us ke husn ke liye nikah kare, Allah use sirf pasti mein badhayega; aur jo is liye nikah kare ke apni nazar jhukaye, apni sharmgah ki hifazat kare, ya sila-rehmi kare, to Allah us ke liye us aurat mein aur us aurat ke liye us mein barkat dega."
"777","[AI-translation] Aurton se un ke husn ke liye nikah na karo, ho sakta hai un ka husn unhen halak kar de; un se un ke maal ke liye nikah na karo, ho sakta hai un ka maal unhen sarkash bana de; balke un se deen ki bunyad par nikah karo, aur Beshak deendar kaali laundi jis ki naak chhidi ho us be-deen khoobsurat maal-dar aurat se behtar hai."
"778","[AI-translation] Bewaqoof aurat se nikah na karo, kyunke us ki suhbat aazmaish hai aur us ki aulad mein nuqsan hai."
"779","[AI-translation] Apni aulad ke liye [aurten] soch samajh kar chuno, kyunke aurten aise bachche janti hain jo un ke bhaiyon aur behnon se milte hain."
"780","[AI-translation] Aurton se un ki betiyon ke bare mein mashwara karo."
"781","[AI-translation] ... Kya tum donon andhi ho? Kya tum use nahin dekhtin?"
"782","[AI-translation] Islam mein pehli mohabbat Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki Hazrat Aishah se mohabbat hai."
"783","[AI-translation] Mehar das dirham se kam nahin."
"784","[AI-translation] Tum mein behtareen aurat woh hai jis ka mehar aasan ho."
"785","[AI-translation] Sab se ba-barkat aurat woh hai jis ka kharcha [mehar waghera] sab se kam ho."
"786","[AI-translation] Is nikah ka elan karo, use masjidon mein karo, aur us mein duff bajao."
"787","[AI-translation] Aap ne ek aurat se nikah kiya to logon ne Aap ke sar par ajwa khajooren bikhair din."
"788","[AI-translation] Dhoka aur fareb sirf nikah mein jaiz hai."
"789","[AI-translation] Zaniyan woh aurten hain jo baghair gawah khud apna nikah kar leti hain."
"790","[AI-translation] Jo aurat se nikah kare use qareeb jane se pehle use tohfa de, agarche apna ek joota hi ho."
"791","[AI-translation] Jab tum mein se koi jima kare to sharmgah ki taraf na dekhe, kyunke yeh andhepan lata hai."
"792","[AI-translation] Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki sharmgah kabhi nahin dekhi."
"793","[AI-translation] Jo aurat ki sharmgah dekhe to us ki maan aur beti us ke liye halal nahin rehtin."
"794","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi jima ke waqt ziyada baat na kare, kyunke is se bachcha goonga paida ho sakta hai."
"795","[AI-translation] Mard par apni biwi ke liye waisa hi ban-thanw wajib hai jaisa us par us ke liye wajib hai."
"796","[AI-translation] Main ne tumhen sirf lashkar ke maal-e-ghaneemat se mana kiya hai, walime ki dawat se nahin mana kiya."
"797","[AI-translation] Aurton ki khwahish mardon se dogni hai."
"798","[AI-translation] Kisi musalman aurat ke liye jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhti ho jaiz nahin ke Yahudi, Isai ya Majoosi ke samne apne baal ya seene ka kuch hissa khole; jo aisa kare us mein amanat nahin."
"799","[AI-translation] Jo aurat apne shohar ke ghar se us ki ijazat ke baghair nikle, suraj aur chaand jis par tulu hote hain har cheez us par la'nat karti hai siwae is ke ke us ka shohar us se razi ho jae."
"800","[AI-translation] Woh apne ghar se us ki ijazat ke baghair na nikle; agar aisa kare to aasman ke farishte, rehmat ke farishte, aur azab ke farishte [sab] us par la'nat karte hain yahan tak ke woh wapas aae."
"801","[AI-translation] Aurton ki itaat pashemani hai."
"802","[AI-translation] Jo apni biwi ke bure akhlaq par sabr kare, to Allah use Ayub (Alaihissalam) ko un ki aazmaish par diye gae ajr jaisa ajr dega. Aur jo aurat apne shohar ke bure akhlaq par sabr kare, to Allah use Firaun ki biwi Asiya (Alaihassalam) ko diye gae sawab jaisa sawab dega."
"803","[AI-translation] Unhen [aurton ko] upari kamron mein na rakho, unhen likhna padhna na sikhao; unhen soot kaatna sikhao aur Surah Noor sikhao."
"804","[AI-translation] Aurton ki izzat sirf sharif karta hai, aur unhen sirf zaleel zaleel karta hai."
"805","[AI-translation] Biwi ka ghulam halak ho gaya."
"806","[AI-translation] Un se [aurton se] mashwara karo lekin un ki mukhalifat karo."
"807","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi kaam na kare yahan tak ke mashwara kare; agar mashwara karne wala na mile to aurat se mashwara kare phir us ki mukhalifat kare, kyunke us ki mukhalifat mein barkat hai."
"808","[AI-translation] Aurton ke kapde utar lo taake woh ghar ke andar apni khalwat mein baithi rahen."
"809","[AI-translation] Aurton mein nek biwi ki misaal sau kawwon mein ek kawwe ki tarah hai."
"810","[AI-translation] Aurat ka jihad apne shohar ki itaat [aur us se husn-e-sulook] hai."
"811","[AI-translation] Jo aurat mare jabke us ka shohar us se razi ho woh jannat mein dakhil hogi."
"812","[AI-translation] Nek bewa ko aasmanon mein shaheeda kaha gaya hai."
"813","[AI-translation] Main chakne wale mardon ko pasand nahin karta na chakne wali aurton ko [jo jaldi nikah karen aur jaldi talaq den]."
"814","[AI-translation] Jo do afraad ka nikah karane jae, to Allah use har qadam aur har lafz par ek saal ki ibadat ka sawab dega; jo do afraad mein judai dalne jae, to Allah par wajib hai ke qayamat ke din us ke sar ko jahannam ki hazar chattanon par mare."
"815","[AI-translation] Aey Mu'az! Allah ne zameen par koi cheez ghulamon ko azad karne se ziyada mahboob paida nahin ki, aur Allah ne zameen par koi cheez talaq se ziyada napasandeeda paida nahin ki."
"816","[AI-translation] Laundi ki talaq do hain aur us ki iddat do haiz hain."
"817","[AI-translation] Doodh pilane ka haq kaise ada ho? Aap ne farmaya: Ghulam ya laundi de kar."
"818","[AI-translation] Bewaqoof aurat se [bachchon ko] doodh na pilao, kyunke doodh asar karta hai."
"819","[AI-translation] Chaar qismon mein lian nahin: aazad mard aur laundi ke darmiyan ..."
"820","[AI-translation] Nikah karo aur aulad paida karo, kyunke qayamat ke din main tumhari [kasrat par] doosri ummaton par fakhr karunga."
"821","[AI-translation] Beta apne baap ka raaz hai."
"822","[AI-translation] Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hasan bin Ali ki paidaish ke din un ke kaan mein azan kahi: daen kaan mein azan aur baen kaan mein iqamat."
"823","[AI-translation] Jo [bachche ka] naam mere naam par rakhe woh meri kunniyat na rakhe; jo meri kunniyat rakhe woh [bachche ka] naam mere naam par na rakhe."
"824","[AI-translation] Beshak tum qayamat ke din apne naamon aur apne baapon ke naamon se pukare jaoge; to apne naam achche rakho."
"825","[AI-translation] Khatna mardon ke liye sunnat aur aurton ke liye izzat hai."
"826","[AI-translation] Beshak ghair-makhtoon ko Islam mein nahin chhora jaega yahan tak ke khatna karaye agarche assi saal ka ho."
"827","[AI-translation] Woh Baitullah ka hajj na kare yahan tak ke khatna karaye."
"828","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) makhtoon paida hue."
"829","[AI-translation] Jo Islam laye woh khatna karaye agarche bada ho."
"830","[AI-translation] Apne beton ko tairna aur teer-andazi sikhao ..."
"831","[AI-translation] Aadmi ka apne bachche ko adab sikhana us ke liye ek sa' sadqa dene se behtar hai."
"832","[AI-translation] Baap ne apne bachche ko achche adab se behtar tohfa nahin diya."
"833","[AI-translation] Bachche ka baap par haq hai ke woh us ka naam achcha rakhe aur use achcha adab sikhaye."
"834","[AI-translation] Apne bachchon ko rone par na maro ..."
"835","[AI-translation] Jo shafqat se yateem ke sar par hath rakhe, to har baal par jis par us ka hath guzre us ke liye ek neki hai."
"836","[AI-translation] Ek aadmi ne kam aulad ki shikayat ki, to Aap ne use ande aur pyaaz khane ka hukm diya."
"837","[AI-translation] Betiyon se mohabbat karo, kyunke main betiyon ka baap hun."
"838","[AI-translation] Jo apne bete ya beti ke nikah par ek dirham kharch kare, to Allah use har dirham par jannat mein barah sheher dega."
"839","[AI-translation] Woh nutfa jis se bachcha paida hota hai tamam a'za aur ragen kaanp uthti hain."
"840","[AI-translation] Kam ghar wale ek aasani hai, ziyada hona ek tangi hai."
"841","[AI-translation] Apne bachchon ko laqab ghalib hone se pehle kunniyat do."
"842","[AI-translation] Jo bachche ki parwarish kare yahan tak ke woh La ilaha illallah kehne lage, to Allah us se hisab nahin lega."
"843","[AI-translation] Allah us baap par rehem farmaye jo apne bachche ki apne sath neki mein madad kare."
"844","[AI-translation] Apne bachchon mein tohfe mein barabari karo."
"845","[AI-translation] Baap ki apne bachche ke liye dua Nabi ki apni ummat ke liye dua ki tarah hai."
"846","[AI-translation] Apne baapon se neki karo tumhare bete tum se neki karenge."
"847","[AI-translation] Walidain se neki namaz, roza, hajj, umra aur Allah ke raste mein jihad se afzal hai."
"848","[AI-translation] Beshak jannat ki khushbu paanch sau saal ki doori se mehsoos hogi, lekin nafarman us ki khushbu se mehroom rahega."
"849","[AI-translation] Jab banda apne walidain ke liye dua chhor de to duniya mein aulad se rizq kat jata hai."
"850","[AI-translation] Agar main apne walidain ya un mein se ek ko paun jabke main isha ki namaz mein hun aur us mein Surah Fatiha padh chuka hun, aur woh mujhe pukaren aey Muhammad! to main unhen jawab dunga: Labbaik."
"851","[AI-translation] Jo apni maan ki donon aankhon ke darmiyan bosa de, to yeh us ke liye jahannam se rukawat banega."
"852","[AI-translation] Ek naujawan ki maut ka waqt aaya lekin apni maan ki nafarmani ki wajah se kalima padhne par qadir na hua; phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us ki maan se sifarish ki, jab woh razi ho gayin to woh kalima padhne par qadir ho gaya."
"853","[AI-translation] Walidain aur Rabb ka farmabardar aala illiyyeen mein hoga."
"854","[AI-translation] Beshak banda jis ke walidain ya un mein se ek faut ho jae jabke woh nafarman tha, phir woh un ke liye dua aur maghfirat mangta rahe, yahan tak ke woh Allah ke han farmabardar likh diya jata hai."
"855","[AI-translation] Jo apne walidain ko rehmat ki nazar se dekhe, to Allah us ke liye har nazar par maqbool hajj ka sawab likh deta hai. Sahaba ne poocha: Agarche roz sau martaba dekhe? Aap ne farmaya: Han; Allah sab se bada aur sab se paak hai."
"856","[AI-translation] Donon tumhari jannat aur tumhari jahannam hain."
"857","[AI-translation] Jab halal aur haraam jama hon to haraam ghalib aata hai."
"858","[AI-translation] Jo haraam ka luqma khae to chalis raaton tak us ki namaz qubool nahin hoti."
"859","[AI-translation] Jo haraam ka ek dirham chhor de, to Allah use jahannam se azad kar dega ..."
"860","[AI-translation] Jo apni rozi ke mamle mein seedha na ho woh apne deen ke mamle mein bhi seedha nahin."
"861","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah farigh naujawan ko napasand farmata hai."
"862","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah farigh aadmi ko napasand farmata hai."
"863","[AI-translation] Mera koi banda halal se haya na kare siwae is ke ke Allah use haraam mein mubtala kar dega."
"864","[AI-translation] Jo haraam tareeqe se maal haasil kare to Allah use halakat mein le jata hai."
"865","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah ka ek farishta Bait-ul-Maqdis mein hai jo har raat elan karta hai: jo haraam khae to us ka na nafl qubool hoga na farz."
"866","[AI-translation] Agar jannat wale tijarat karte to kapde ki tijarat karte."
"867","[AI-translation] Buzdil tajir mehroom hai, bahadur tajir rozi pata hai."
"868","[AI-translation] Achchi khattati seekho, kyunke Beshak woh rizq ki kunjiyan hain."
"869","[AI-translation] Badtareen log tajir aur kisan hain."
"870","[AI-translation] Aakhri zamane mein badtareen maal ghulam aur laundiyan honge."
"871","[AI-translation] Meri ummat ke bakheel darzi hain."
"872","[AI-translation] Aey Allah! Ham mein tajir aur musafir ki rae hum par musallat na farma, kyunke hamara tajir mehengai chahta hai aur hamara musafir barish ko napasand karta hai."
"873","[AI-translation] Jo meri ummat par ek raat bhi mehengai chahe to Allah us ke chalis saal ke a'mal zae kar dega."
"874","[AI-translation] [Bazar mein] maal lane wala rozi pata hai, jabke zakheera karne wale par la'nat hai."
"875","[AI-translation] Jo chalis raaton tak ghalla roke rakhe to woh Allah se alag ho gaya aur Allah us se alag ho gaya."
"876","[AI-translation] Jo Musalmanon se chalis din ghalla roke rakhe phir use sadqa kar de, to yeh us ke liye kaffara na hoga."
"877","[AI-translation] Har qarz jo nafa lae sood hai."
"878","[AI-translation] Haya rizq rokti hai."
"879","[AI-translation] Bartan dhona aur sehan saaf karna [donon] daulat late hain."
"880","[AI-translation] Jab tum fajr padh lo to rizq talash karne ke bajaye so na jao."
"881","[AI-translation] Do qismen hain jinhen Allah ne duniya aur aakhirat mein izzat di: sona aur chandi; Allah ne unhen duniya walon ke liye izzat aur aakhirat walon ke liye zeenat banaya."
"882","[AI-translation] Dirham is liye kaha gaya kyunke woh gham ka ghar hai, deenar is liye kaha gaya kyunke woh aag ka ghar hai."
"883","[AI-translation] Allah ne rizq jismon se do hazar saal pehle paida kiya ..."
"884","[AI-translation] Pani mein machhli na kharido, kyunke yeh dhoka hai."
"885","[AI-translation] Aap ne udhar ke badle udhar ki farokht se mana farmaya."
"886","[AI-translation] Jo baghair dekhe khareede, phir dekhne ke baad use ikhtiyar hai."
"887","[AI-translation] Ghaib aur chhote bachche ke liye shufa nahin; aur shufa rassi kholne ki tarah hai."
"888","[AI-translation] Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: Main do shareekon mein teesra hun jab tak un mein se ek apne sathi se khayanat na kare."
"889","[AI-translation] Girwi rakhi cheez us ke malik se nahin roki jaegi jis ne use girwi rakha; us ka faeda bhi us ke liye hai aur us ka nuqsan bhi us par hai."
"890","[AI-translation] Khane se pehle [hath dhona] ek neki hai, khane ke baad [dhona] do nekiyan hain."
"891","[AI-translation] Khane se pehle aur baad mein [hath] dhona faqr ko door karta hai."
"892","[AI-translation] Rizq mein wus'at aur shaitani tareeqe ko rokna: khane se pehle aur baad mein [hath] dhona."
"893","[AI-translation] Khane ki barkat us se pehle aur baad mein [hath] dhona hai."
"894","[AI-translation] Jo khane se pehle bismillah kehna bhool jae woh farigh hone par Qul Huwallahu Ahad padhe."
"895","[AI-translation] Aey Ali! Namak lazmi istemal karo, kyunke woh sattar beemariyon ka ilaj hai: kodh, bars aur pagalpan."
"896","[AI-translation] Jo apne subah ke khane ka aaghaz namak se kare, to Allah us se sattar qism ki beemariyan door kar dega."
"897","[AI-translation] Tumhare saalanon ka sardar namak hai."
"898","[AI-translation] Jo dastarkhwan ya bartan se gira luqma utha kar khae, to woh faqr, bewaqoofi aur kodh ki beemari se mehfooz rahega."
"899","[AI-translation] Jo bartan mein khae phir use chaat le, to bartan us ke liye maghfirat mangta hai."
"900","[AI-translation] Jab woh khane se farigh hote to farmate: Sab tareef Allah ke liye jis ne hamen khilaya, pilaya, aur Musalman banaya."
"901","[AI-translation] Jab tum koi khana khao ya mashroob piyo aur yeh dua padho Bismillah-illazi la yazurru ma'a ismihi shaiun fil-arzi wa la fis-sama Ya Hayyu Ya Qayyum, to us khane se tumhen koi beemari na pahunchegi agarche us mein zeher ho."
"902","[AI-translation] Bazar mein khana pasti hai."
"903","[AI-translation] Roti ki izzat karo, kyunke Allah ne us ke liye aasman ki barkaten utarin aur us ke liye zameen ki barkaten nikali."
"904","[AI-translation] Roti ki izzat karo kyunke Allah bhi us ki izzat farmata hai, aur jo roti ki izzat kare Allah bhi us ki izzat farmayega."
"905","[AI-translation] Jo qaum roti ke haq ko haqeer samjhe, Allah use bhook mein mubtala kar deta hai."
"906","[AI-translation] Roti ko chhuri se na kato jaise ghair-Arab katte hain."
"907","[AI-translation] Roti chhoti rakho aur us ki ta'dad badhao; tumhare liye us mein barkat hogi."
"908","[AI-translation] Aey Allah! Hamen Islam aur roti se faeda de; agar roti na hoti to ham na roza rakhte, na namaz padhte, na hajj karte, na jihad karte."
"909","[AI-translation] Teen khane ka hisab na hoga: sehri ka khana, jis se iftar kare, aur jo bhaiyon ke sath khaye."
"910","[AI-translation] Khane par phoonkna barkat le jata hai."
"911","[AI-translation] Jo qaum pet bhar kar raat guzare us ke akhlaq achche hote hain; jo qaum bhooke raat guzare us ke akhlaq bure hote hain."
"912","[AI-translation] Agar woh subah khate to shaam na khate, aur agar shaam khate to subah na khate."
"913","[AI-translation] Jab bhi woh khana khate to Allah ki hamd farmate phir yeh dua padhte Allahumma barik lana feehi wa at'imna atyaba minhu [Aey Allah hamare liye us mein barkat de aur hamen us se behtar khila]."
"914","[AI-translation] Duniya walon aur jannat walon ke khane ka sardar gosht hai."
"915","[AI-translation] Beshak gosht khane par dil khush hota hai."
"916","[AI-translation] Gosht gosht badhata hai; jo chalis din gosht chhore us ke akhlaq bigad jaenge."
"917","[AI-translation] Zaitoon khao aur us ka tel lagao, kyunke woh paak aur ba-barkat hai."
"918","[AI-translation] Doodh peena khalis iman hai; jo khwab mein doodh piye woh iman aur fitrat par hai."
"919","[AI-translation] Tawazo mein se hai ke aadmi apne bhai ka bacha hua piye; jo Allah ki raza ke liye apne bhai ka bacha hua piye, us ke sattar darje buland kiye jaenge ..."
"920","[AI-translation] Jo Musalman ko pani ka ghoont pilaye jahan pani ho, goya us ne ghulam azad kiya; jo Musalman ko pani ka ghoont pilaye jahan pani na ho, goya us ne momin jaan ko zindagi di."
"921","[AI-translation] Garmi ke din pani par pani pilao, tumhare gunah is tarah jhad jaenge jaise tez aandhi mein darakht se patte jhadte hain."
"922","[AI-translation] Khane mein chawal qaum mein sardar ki tarah hai ..."
"923","[AI-translation] Chawal mujh se hai aur main chawal se hun; chawal mere noor ke baqi hisse se paida kiya gaya ..."
"924","[AI-translation] Jo chalis din chawal khae to us ke dil se us ki zaban par hikmat ke chashme phoot padenge."
"925","[AI-translation] Masoor lazmi istemal karo, kyunke woh ba-barkat aur paak hai."
"926","[AI-translation] Masoor lazmi istemal karo, kyunke woh sattar Nabiyon ki zaban par paak qaraar diya gaya."
"927","[AI-translation] Baingan mein har beemari ka ilaj hai aur us mein koi beemari nahin."
"928","[AI-translation] Baingan khao aur kasrat se khao, kyunke Beshak woh pehla darakht hai jo main ne jannat-ul-Ma'wa mein dekha."
"929","[AI-translation] Khane se pehle tarbooz pet ko dho deta hai aur beemari ko jad se khatm karta hai."
"930","[AI-translation] Meri ummat ki bahar angoor aur tarbooz hai."
"931","[AI-translation] Kaddu lazmi khao, kyunke woh aql badhata hai."
"932","[AI-translation] Aey Ali! Jab safar ka saman lo to pyaaz na bhoolna."
"933","[AI-translation] Pyaaz lazmi istemal karo, kyunke woh nutfe ko paak karta hai aur bachcha sehatmand paida hota hai."
"934","[AI-translation] Jo kheera gosht ke sath khae woh kodh ki beemari se mehfooz rahega."
"935","[AI-translation] Momin ka dil meetha hai; woh mithas pasand karta hai."
"936","[AI-translation] Beshak duniya mein bhooke rehne wale aakhirat mein ser honge."
"937","[AI-translation] Paneer beemari hai aur akhrot bhi beemari hai; jab donon jama hon to do shifa ban jate hain."
"938","[AI-translation] Telon ka sardar banafsha hai; banafshe ki baqi telon par fazeelat aisi hai jaise Islam ki baqi mazhabon par fazeelat hai."
"939","[AI-translation] Jis ke ghar mein bakri ho us ke ghar mein barkat hogi."
"940","[AI-translation] Murghe ko bura na kaho, kyunke woh mera dost hai aur main us ka dost hun."
"941","[AI-translation] Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) kabootar udate the."
"942","[AI-translation] Kawwe aur gidh ke siwa har parinda khane mein koi harj nahin."
"943","[AI-translation] Sahi ... na-paak janwaron mein se na-paak janwar hai."
"944","[AI-translation] Beshak israf mein se hai ke jab chaaho khao."
"945","[AI-translation] Mitti khana nifaq lata hai."
"946","[AI-translation] Mitti khana har Musalman par haraam hai."
"947","[AI-translation] Jo mitti khae aur us se ghusl kare, to [goya] us ne apne baap [Adam] ka gosht khaya aur us ke khoon se ghusl kiya."
"948","[AI-translation] Sahaba ne poocha: Ya Rasulullah! Yeh qurbaniyan kya hain? Aap ne farmaya: Tumhare baap Ibrahim ki sunnat. Unhon ne poocha: Hamen in mein kya milega? Aap ne farmaya: Har baal par ek neki."
"949","[AI-translation] Ek aadmi ne Hazrat Ibn Umar se qurbani ke bare mein poocha, kya woh wajib hai? Unhon ne jawab diya: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aur Musalmanon ne qurbani ki. Phir us ne dobara poocha, to Unhon ne farmaya: Kya tum samajhte ho? Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aur Musalmanon ne qurbani ki."
"950","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Madinah mein das saal rahe aur [har saal] qurbani karte rahe."
"951","[AI-translation] Zabh ke din Adam ke bete ka Allah ko sab se mahboob amal khoon bahana hai; yeh janwar qayamat ke din apne seengon, khuron aur baalon ke sath aaenge; khoon zameen par girne se pehle Allah Azza wa Jalla ke han maqam pata hai; to use khushi se ada karo."
"952","[AI-translation] Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe waseeyat ki ke main Aap ki taraf se qurbani karun, to main Aap ki taraf se qurbani karta hun."
"953","[AI-translation] Beshak ood, sandal, mushk, ambar aur kafoor Adam ke libas mein se hain jin mein woh jannat se utare gae."
"954","[AI-translation] Ghutna satr mein shamil hai."
"955","[AI-translation] Amame ke sath namaz [baghair amame ke] pachees [namazon] ke barabar hai, amame ke sath juma [baghair amame ke] sattar jumon ke barabar hai."
"956","[AI-translation] Sar par amame ke sath namaz ka sawab Allah ke han Allah ke raste mein jihad ke barabar hai."
"957","[AI-translation] Amama bandho tumhare hilm mein izafa hoga."
"958","[AI-translation] Amame lazmi pehno, kyunke Beshak woh farishton ki nishani hain ..."
"959","[AI-translation] Hamare aur mushrikon ke darmiyan farq topiyon par amame bandhna hai."
"960","[AI-translation] Farishton ka libas aadhi pindli tak hai."
"961","[AI-translation] Apne kapde teh karo un ki rooh un mein wapas aaegi; Beshak shaitan teh kiye kapde paye to nahin pehenta; agar bikhre paye to pehenta hai."
"962","[AI-translation] Jo Allah ke sath baithna chahe woh oon pehenne walon ke sath baithe."
"963","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) [oon ka libas] pehne wafat paye ..."
"964","[AI-translation] Woh kamarband pehente the."
"965","[AI-translation] Jo oont bandhe aur oon ka libas pehne woh takabbur se bari hai."
"966","[AI-translation] Jo peele joote pehne woh khushi mein rahega jab tak pehne rakhe."
"967","[AI-translation] Munafiq ki nishani us ki shalwar ka lamba hona hai."
"968","[AI-translation] Angoothi ke sath namaz baghair angoothi ke sattar ke barabar hai."
"969","[AI-translation] Aqeeq ki angoothi pehno, kyunke woh ba-barkat hai."
"970","[AI-translation] Jannat ke zyada tar nag aqeeq ke hain."
"971","[AI-translation] Jo aqeeq ki angoothi pehne woh hamesha khair dekhega."
"972","[AI-translation] Jo yaqoot ke nag wali angoothi pehne, to Allah us ka faqr door kar dega."
"973","[AI-translation] Zamurrad pehno, kyunke woh aasani hai us mein koi dushwari nahin."
"974","[AI-translation] Allah ke raste mein ek dirham kharch karna [saat sau ke] barabar hai, mehndi mein ek dirham kharch karna [saat hazar ke] barabar hai."
"975","[AI-translation] Jo mehndi lagaye mare to Munkar aur Nakeer us se qabr mein sawal na karenge."
"976","[AI-translation] Jo duniya mein moonchhen lambi rakhe, to Allah qayamat ke din us ki nadamat lambi karega."
"977","[AI-translation] Aasman ke farishte peshani ke balon wali aurton aur dadhi wale mardon ke liye maghfirat mangte hain; kehte hain: Paak hai Woh jis ne mardon ko dadhiyon se aur aurton ko peshani ke balon se muzayyan kiya."
"978","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi apni dadhi na kate, lekin kanpati ke baal [le sakta hai]."
"979","[AI-translation] Woh apni dadhi chaudai aur lambai se lete the."
"980","[AI-translation] Jo har raat apne sar aur dadhi mein kanghi kare to woh mukhtalif aazmaishon se mehfooz rahega aur us ki umar badha di jaegi."
"981","[AI-translation] Jo khade ho kar kanghi kare us par qarz chadh jaega."
"982","[AI-translation] Kanghi Aap se hazar mein na safar mein juda hoti thi."
"983","[AI-translation] Jo hafta ke din apne nakhun kate to us se beemari nikal jayegi aur shifa dakhil hogi ..."
"984","[AI-translation] Beshak gulab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paseene se paida kiya gaya."
"985","[AI-translation] Jis raat mujhe le jaya gaya, mera paseena zameen par gira phir us se gulab uga; jo meri khushbu soonghna chahe woh gulab soonghe."
"986","[AI-translation] Jab tum mein se kisi ke paas khushbu lai jae to use lagaye; jab mithas lai jae to use khaye."
"987","[AI-translation] Jannat ke khushbudar paudon ka sardar mehndi hai."
"988","[AI-translation] Loban meri aur farishton ki khushbu hai ..."
"989","[AI-translation] Nargis soongho agarche din mein ek martaba, mahine mein ek martaba, saal mein ek martaba, aur umar mein ek martaba."
"990","[AI-translation] Woh har raat surma lagate the, har mahine pichhne lagwate the, aur har saal dawa peete the."
"991","[AI-translation] Pagalpan, kodh, bars mein ... sar par pichhne lagwae jaen."
"992","[AI-translation] Jo pichhne lagwana chahe woh satrah, unnees ya ikkees [tareekh] ikhtiyar kare."
"993","[AI-translation] Pandrah, satrah, unnees ya ikkees [ko] pichhne lagwao."
"994","[AI-translation] Aap ne hafta aur budh ko pichhne lagwane se mana farmaya."
"995","[AI-translation] Juma mein ek ghadi hai jis mein agar koi pichhne lagwaye to mar jaega."
"996","[AI-translation] Ek din ka bukhar saal bhar ke gunahon ka kaffara hai."
"997","[AI-translation] Momin ke wuzu ke bache hue pani ke peene mein har beemari ki shifa hai, sab se kam gham hai."
"998","[AI-translation] Momin ka luaab bhi shifa hai."
"999","[AI-translation] Bakheel ka khana beemari hai, jabke sakhi ka khana shifa hai."
"1000","[AI-translation] Maida beemariyon ka ghar hai, parhez dawa ki bunyad hai."
"1001","[AI-translation] Maida badan ka hauz hai; ragen us mein utarti hain; agar maida durust ho to ragen sehat le kar laut-ti hain; agar maida bigad jae to ragen beemari le kar laut-ti hain."
"1002","[AI-translation] Aankh ki dawa use na chhuna hai."
"1003","[AI-translation] Beenai ka jana gunahon ki maghfirat hai, sama'at ka jana gunahon ki maghfirat hai, aur jism ka jo hissa kam ho usi qadar [maghfirat hai]."
"1004","[AI-translation] Aadmi ke ek paon ka jana us ke aadhe gunahon ki maghfirat hai, donon ka jana us ke tamam gunahon ki maghfirat hai."
"1005","[AI-translation] Jo har mahine teen subah khaali pet shehed chaate use badi balaa na pahunchegi."
"1006","[AI-translation] Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kodh ke mareez ka hath pakda phir use apne sath bartan mein rakha, farmaya: Allah par bharosa aur tawakkul karte hue khao."
"1007","[AI-translation] Tibb mein aakhri ilaj daaghna hai."
"1008","[AI-translation] Surah Fatiha har beemari ki shifa hai."
